      "role": "user",
      "content": "Structure the requirements for this job posting:\n**ROLES ALL ACROSS EUROPE, NOT JUST GERMANY, APPLY TO THIS FOR ALL LOCATIONS** \n\n\n\n\n***Circa. \u20ac80'000 \\+ \u20ac13'000 NET/ year \\+ Accommodation \\+ Flights \\+ Travel***\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n Are you an Electrical Engineer looking to develop your career on some of Europe's most advanced and high\\-profile data centre projects?\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n We are seeking a motivated Electrical Engineer to join a growing project delivery team supporting the construction of large\\-scale hyperscale data centres. Working alongside senior engineers, package managers and project leadership, you will play a key role in coordinating electrical installations, monitoring progress and ensuring works are delivered safely, on time and to the highest quality standards.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n This is an excellent opportunity for individuals looking to gain exposure to complex mission\\-critical infrastructure projects and accelerate their career within a rapidly expanding sector.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Key Responsibilities** \n\n\n\n\n \u2022 Support the delivery of electrical systems from design coordination through installation, commissioning and handover.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Review drawings, specifications, technical submittals and RFIs.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Coordinate with subcontractors, suppliers and project stakeholders on site.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Monitor installation progress and assist in tracking programme milestones.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Support quality inspections, snagging and closeout activities.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Assist with testing, commissioning and system handover processes.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Ensure works are delivered in accordance with project specifications and safety requirements.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Prepare progress reports and maintain project documentation.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Identify and escalate technical issues, risks and potential programme impacts.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Candidate Requirements** \n\n\n\n\n \u2022 Degree, HNC/HND or equivalent qualification in Electrical Engineering or a related discipline.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Experience within construction, building services, industrial, pharmaceutical, mission\\-critical or data centre projects.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Understanding of electrical systems including power distribution, switchgear, generators, transformers, UPS systems and containment.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Ability to interpret technical drawings and specifications.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Strong organisational and communication skills.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Proficient in Microsoft Office and common construction management software.\n \n\n\n\n \u2022 Eager to learn, develop and progress within a fast\\-paced project environment.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**What's On Offer*
